    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recommendations for improving international trade in services provided</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will collaborate with the Department of Economic and Social Affairs (DESA), the Economic Cooperation Organization (ECO) and the United Nations Economic and Social Commission for Asia and the Pacific (ESCAP) in organizing a UN Workshop on International Trade in Services Statistics to improve understanding of the MSITS - 2010. UNDP in Turkmenistan will coordinate the Terms of Reference for the consultants and experts who need to be hired, the concept notes of the workshops, and the involvement of the experts from these organizations in the project activities. UNDP will also ensure the participation of TurkmenStat&apos;s employees in the events, workshops, and trainings organized by these organizations.</narrative>
